{"id":"n62380-2-11","stage":2,"title":"점 · 痣","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62380-2-11-1","ko":"너는 걔 어디가 그렇게 예쁘니?","zh":"你觉得她哪里那么漂亮啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"걔","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}},{"text":"어디가","meaning":"哪里、哪一点（询问漂亮之处）","explanation":"어디：哪里、哪一点（询问漂亮之处）；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디가","audio":"/audio/6d28cfb014a6b7e4f086.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘니?","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘니","audio":"/audio/260ab9c2f5dae8c9c839.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里、哪一点（询问漂亮之处）","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"哪里、哪一点（询问漂亮之处）","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/682a421686ce4972d3bd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62380-2-11-2","ko":"얼굴에 난 점까지도 다 예뻐.","zh":"就连她脸上的痣也都很漂亮。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴에","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴에","audio":"/audio/9ac369fc067ad882131a.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"长出，发，生","explanation":"나다：长出，发，生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"점까지도","meaning":"痣","explanation":"점：痣；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"점","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62380","senseId":"2","lemma":"점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점까지도","audio":"/audio/a2d91f96d2cebf13bf0b.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"连","explanation":"다：连","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176",